WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to TrendLens AI. Turn many public updates into one clear report.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 1. Pick who the report is for. For example: student, analyst, responder, or public audience.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step 2. Tell the app why you need the report. Use one short sentence.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3. Paste public sources. Use articles, alerts, reports, or updates. Do not paste private or secret information.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4. Choose the report parts you want. You can select BLUF, summary, confidence, risks, RFIs, and a 45-second brief.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 5. Click Generate TrendLens Report. The model asks to use the tool: analyze_public_sources.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Step 6. Read the report. Check the source comparison, confidence, gaps, and follow-up questions.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Step 7. Save your work. You can save the report, download it, and save an evaluation record.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Remember. TrendLens AI helps organize public information. It does not prove facts by itself. A person should still review the report.

